CHECK:UNNECESSARY_PARENTHESES: Unnecessary parentheses around 'pr->pr_type > GNU_PROPERTY_X86_FEATURE_1_AND'
#249: FILE: arch/x86/kernel/elf.c:91:
+	if ((buf + sizeof(*pr) +  pr->pr_datasz < buf) ||
+	    (pr->pr_type > GNU_PROPERTY_X86_FEATURE_1_AND) ||
+	    (pr->pr_type > max_type))

Parentheses are not required in the following cases:

  1. Function pointer uses::

      (foo->bar)();

    could be::

      foo->bar();

  2. Comparisons in if::

      if ((foo->bar) && (foo->baz))
      if ((foo == bar))

    could be::

      if (foo->bar && foo->baz)
      if (foo == bar)

  3. addressof/dereference single Lvalues::

      &(foo->bar)
      *(foo->bar)

    could be::

      &foo->bar
      *foo->bar

